================================================================================
WHY AGPL
================================================================================

CelineUI is compiled into AURA, GALLERY and Céline, which are built on JUCE
under its free licence and so are AGPLv3. The interface they share is under the
same terms.

This repository is public for the same reason the plugins are: anyone given a
binary is entitled to the corresponding source for that exact build. Each plugin
pins the CelineUI commit it was built against, and each release is built from a
tagged commit of the plugin, so the source of a release is always reachable.


================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

The code here is built against JUCE (AGPLv3, (C) Raw Material Software Limited)
but does not bundle it. The fonts and marks the interface draws are not in this
repository: each plugin ships them in its own assets/ and lists them in its own
licence.
